/* core/Layout — the tree, a layout page, and the fixture boxes.

   Every rule is in `@layer theme`: the order lives once, in framework.css, and
   `@layer util` beats `theme` at any specificity, so nothing here may go there.

   ⚠ The whole file is one namespace, `page-layout-`, declared in
   styles/css-scopes.txt. `page-` is core/Page's; `layout-` is ext/layout's. */

